+// P4 region translator (docs/region-translator.md): a function as a region
+// fragment. The block emitter runs in fragment mode (helper calls
+// relocatable, halts return 2) and the tail RunWasmBlock runs for a completed
+// block moves into the fragment: pc = npc, downcount -= the block's cycles.
+// The performance monitor is not updated on this path yet.
+namespace
+{
